Error [E1102]: `d` cannot be shared into a task — it is a view that does not live long enough
  --> tests/ui/string_view_task_capture.jet:6:22
    |
  6 |     t :: tasks.spawn(() => d)
    |                      ^^^^^^^
 Why: a view is a borrow, not an owned value; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: give the task plain owned data, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before spawning

Error [E2307]: `d` can't be used directly here yet
  --> tests/ui/string_view_task_capture.jet:6:28
    |
  6 |     t :: tasks.spawn(() => d)
    |                            ^
 Why: `d` is a zero-copy view into `email` (`.trim()`/`.after()`/`.before()`); only chaining another `.trim()`/`.after()`/`.before()` on it works directly — other methods and calls need the full owned value
 Fix: write `~d` first to get an owned `String`, then use that
